https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=grBFMP3HDZA,"I'm as well indebted and elated to meet  you and Abao, virtually as it were. I quickly searched Pomodoro and I love this method. I've an tremendous amount of work to do in three to four different areas of study all of it self paced and consisting of me searching out resources to reach the end goal. I realized after so much bouncing around and research for direction that the only way I'll do this is to develop my own syllabus and set hours. With this technique in my tool box and now having a defined goal set, I believe I can reach it. Thank you Abao, very much, it's a thrill to study with you and the others from halfway around the world. Peace to you, and you Ashvini Bandara.","I'm as well indebted and elated to meet you and Abao, virtually as it were. I quickly searched Pomodoro and I love this method. I've an tremendous amount of work to do in three to four different areas of study all of it self paced and consisting of me searching out resources to reach the end goal. I realized after so much bouncing around and research for direction that the only way I'll do this is to develop my own syllabus and set hours. With this technique in my tool box and now having a defined goal set, I believe I can reach it. Thank you Abao, very much, it's a thrill to study with you and the others from halfway around the world. Peace to you, and you Ashvini Bandara.",low
