https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=grBFMP3HDZA,"Make sure your room is well aired out and well-lit. Eat well and have water and small snacks ready for focus. Don't be too cold or too warm. While studying, write down distractions and things like chores you suddenly remember so that you can do them after or in your break. Use headphones and self-control apps that lock distracting sites etc. Don't consume caffeine after midday so that you sleep better and have more energy the next day. Plan the next day and pack your bag in the evening. Good job!","Make sure your room is well aired out and well-lit. Eat well and have water and small snacks ready for focus. Don't be too cold or too warm. While studying, write down distractions and things like chores you suddenly remember so that you can do them after or in your break. Use headphones and self-control apps that lock distracting sites etc. Don't consume caffeine after midday so that you sleep better and have more energy the next day. Plan the next day and pack your bag in the evening. Good job!",low
