https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=grBFMP3HDZA,"I'm here for the second time now. This really helps me focusing and the questions you put in the breaks immediately distract me from the work I'm doing.
Right now I'm studying for a math test which I have tomorrow. I also have some English, German and Italian Homework I have to do today and I'm working on a projekt. I'm writing a book! I'm really curious how it turns out..

Here for the third time now. I'm studying for a biology test i have tomorrow. I'ts a lot more than I expected. But I got this! I also worked on my project but it's kinda hard because I procastinate often..

Aaand for the fourth time! Right now I'm studying for some missed German lessons. I also have an English test, a math test and a geography test to study for. In addition to that I have to do some math and Italian homework too and I need to continue writing on my book! I am strangely motivated right now :)

For the fifth time :) I'm studying English right now and have to continue working on my project, I need to finish a document for PE, have a chemistry test i have to study for and need to prepare a presentation for English. I also have some Math, German, History, Italian and English Homework to do. That's a lot of work and I just hope I can finish everything..

For the sixth time already. Haven't been here for quite some time but it feels good to be back.. I changed school now and rn I'm studying for a history test I have the day after tomorrow. Tomorrow I also have a math test but I think I'm more or less fine with that one. I get most of the things I have to know there and I'm just gonna do some practise later.

