ctise later. Wow i haven't been here in so long this really takes me back to a few years ago! I started writing this comment when I was 15 years old. Now I'm 19... this is so nice :) I'm doing a lot better than I used to. A lot has happened in these four years. Now I'm working on a big music project I have to hand in tomorrow... Seems like I still procrastinate way too much but oh well, that's just how I work.",low
