https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=grBFMP3HDZA,"@BytePodVibe ik this happens with me but because of this I learnt one thing that we shouldn't stop to give our best.......I do one thing if it could help u....
Science:- for chemistry u can make reaction sheets for every chapter and solve questions from reference book ( don't do too many reference books).... for bio ncert is enough but for heredity and control and coordination there is very less info given so u can do that chp from yt or if u go to any classes u can do that...for physics same thing but most importantly make formula sheet it really helped me....
Maths:- Most importantly and first most thing is to solve ncert fully ( examples, exercise and optional exercises) and if u have time so u can do any reference books like rs or Rd. 
But for all subs. MCQs practice and sample paper solving is important
Hope this will help u :) all the best for boards","@BytePodVibe ik this happens with me but because of this I learnt one thing that we shouldn't stop to give our best.......I do one thing if it could help u.... Science:- for chemistry u can make reaction sheets for every chapter and solve questions from reference book ( don't do too many reference books).... for bio ncert is enough but for heredity and control and coordination there is very less info given so u can do that chp from yt or if u go to any classes u can do that...for physics same thing but most importantly make formula sheet it really helped me.... Maths:- Most importantly and first most thing is to solve ncert fully ( examples, exercise and optional exercises) and if u have time so u can do any reference books like rs or Rd. But for all subs. MCQs practice and sample paper solving is important Hope this will help u :) all the best for boards",low
